-    - Iterate through all voxels $(z, y, x)$:
-      - Let $v_x = x + y \times N_X + z \times N_X \times N_Y$.
-      - If `img[v_x] >= isolevel`:
-        - `lo[0] = MIN(x, lo[0])`
-        - `lo[1] = MIN(y, lo[1])`
-        - `lo[2] = MIN(z, lo[2])`
